{"id":"isagis_first_goal","lines":[{"t":3.09,"end":4.554,"chars":[0],"who":"Okuhito (Lemon)","text":"It's one on one...","de":"Eins gegen eins …","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":4.826,"end":6.77,"chars":[0],"who":"Okuhito (Lemon)","text":"If I don't save this, it's over!","de":"Wenn ich den nicht halte, ist es vorbei!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":6.876,"end":10.044,"chars":[0],"who":"Okuhito (Lemon)","text":"All our soccer careers end here… forever!","de":"Unsere ganzen Fußballkarrieren enden hier … für immer!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":10.505,"end":14.249,"chars":[0],"who":"Okuhito (Lemon)","text":"I have to block his shot… no matter what!","de":"Ich muss seinen Schuss abwehren … koste es, was es wolle!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":14.709,"end":16.365,"chars":[0],"who":"Okuhito (Lemon)","text":"(confused gasps)","de":"(keucht verwirrt)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":19.149,"end":20.613,"chars":[0],"who":"Okuhito (Lemon)","text":"Where'd he come from…","de":"Wo kommt der denn her …","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":21.397,"end":22.813,"chars":[0],"who":"Okuhito (Lemon)","text":"(grunt)","de":"(ächzt)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":23.662,"end":25.15,"chars":[1],"who":"Raichi","text":"It's all over…","de":"Es ist alles vorbei …","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":25.868,"end":27.764,"chars":[2],"who":"Naruhaya","text":"We're screwed…","de":"Wir sind geliefert …","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":32.886,"end":34.11,"chars":[0],"who":"Okuhito (Lemon)","text":"(gasp)","de":"(keucht)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":32.886,"end":34.11,"chars":[3],"who":"Team Y Player","text":"(gasp)","de":"(keucht)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":36.949,"end":39.949,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"Here… you and I know this spot, right?","de":"Hier … du und ich kennen diesen Ort, oder?","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":40.209,"end":42.201,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"'Cause it's where we belong.","de":"Denn hier gehören wir hin.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":42.285,"end":44.277,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"The place where you can smell a goal!","de":"Der Ort, an dem man ein Tor riechen kann!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":44.158,"end":45.382,"chars":[5],"who":"Niko","text":"(gasp)","de":"(keucht)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":46.55,"end":51.35,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"You and I are alike. The way we see and how we read the field!","de":"Du und ich sind uns ähnlich. Wie wir sehen und wie wir das Spiel lesen!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":51.694,"end":56.398,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"Instead of taking the shot yourself, you passed to Okawa to finish us off.","de":"Statt selbst zu schießen, hast du zu Okawa gepasst, damit er uns erledigt.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":56.66,"end":58.46,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"That's why you lost, Niko.","de":"Deshalb hast du verloren, Niko.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":58.722,"end":61.914,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"At the last moment, you chose to give up the ball.","de":"Im letzten Moment hast du den Ball abgegeben.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":62.135,"end":65.063,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"Which means you're no striker at all!","de":"Das heißt, du bist überhaupt kein Stürmer!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":66.723,"end":71.451,"chars":[3],"who":"Team Y Player","text":"Oh shit! Stupid punks are countering! Get back! Steal the ball!","de":"Oh Scheiße! Die Penner kontern! Zurück! Holt euch den Ball!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":72.017,"end":76.385,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"I chose to pass rather than take the shot… and cried when we lost.","de":"Ich hab gepasst, statt zu schießen … und geweint, als wir verloren haben.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":76.686,"end":81.63,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"That version of myself is a memory. I don't need it anymore. I want to win!","de":"Dieses alte Ich ist nur noch eine Erinnerung. Ich brauche es nicht mehr. Ich will gewinnen!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":83.43,"end":86.526,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"Now is the time… to be reborn!","de":"Jetzt ist es Zeit … neu geboren zu werden!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":86.728,"end":87.856,"chars":[6],"who":"Kunigami","text":"(grunt)","de":"(ächzt)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":87.976,"end":90.592,"chars":[6],"who":"Kunigami","text":"(light gasp) Nice pass, Isagi.","de":"(keucht leise) Guter Pass, Isagi.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":91.473,"end":96.801,"chars":[6],"who":"Kunigami","text":"(grunting) Damn it! It's up to you!","de":"(ächzt) Verdammt! Jetzt liegt's an dir!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":91.516,"end":96.244,"chars":[7],"who":"Team Y Player 2","text":"(grunt) Just foul him if you have to! (keep grunting)","de":"(ächzt) Foul ihn einfach, wenn's sein muss! (ächzt weiter)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":91.587,"end":96.099,"chars":[8],"who":"Team Y Player 3","text":"(grunting) Just stop him! (more grunting)","de":"(ächzt) Halt ihn einfach auf! (ächzt weiter)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":96.518,"end":99.758,"chars":[9],"who":"Bachira","text":"(soft gasp) I read you loud and clear.","de":"(keucht leise) Hab dich genau verstanden.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":99.589,"end":100.981,"chars":[7],"who":"Team Y Player 2","text":"Take him out!","de":"Schaltet ihn aus!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":100.037,"end":101.261,"chars":[8],"who":"Team Y Player 3","text":"(make some noise)","de":"(irgendein Geräusch)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":101.445,"end":102.429,"chars":[7],"who":"Team Y Player 2","text":"(oof)","de":"(uff)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":102.994,"end":106.09,"chars":[8],"who":"Team Y Player 3","text":"(grunt a couple of times)","de":"(ächzt ein paar Mal)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":103.767,"end":104.727,"chars":[9],"who":"Bachira","text":"(soft grunt)","de":"(ächzt leise)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":105.061,"end":105.973,"chars":[9],"who":"Bachira","text":"(grunt like you're getting past someone)","de":"(ächzt, als würdest du an jemandem vorbeiziehen)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":107.978,"end":111.122,"chars":[9],"who":"Bachira","text":"I'll leave the rest to you. (grunt)","de":"Den Rest überlasse ich dir. (ächzt)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":112.013,"end":116.573,"chars":[10],"who":"Gagamaru","text":"That's low… but okay! I'll take it! (gasp, then grunt as if you fell)","de":"Ganz schön flach … aber okay! Den nehm ich! (keucht, dann ächzt wie beim Hinfallen)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":116.321,"end":118.385,"chars":[11],"who":"Igarashi","text":"He missed! We're dead!","de":"Daneben! Wir sind erledigt!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/39.mp3"},{"t":118.092,"end":121.356,"chars":[9],"who":"Bachira","text":"No. You didn't notice I was aiming beyond him.","de":"Nein. Du hast nicht gemerkt, dass ich an ihm vorbei gezielt habe.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/40.mp3"},{"t":123.152,"end":125.12,"chars":[9],"who":"Bachira","text":"At number eleven.","de":"Auf Nummer elf.","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/41.mp3"},{"t":124.875,"end":126.099,"chars":[5],"who":"Niko","text":"(gasp again)","de":"(keucht wieder)","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/42.mp3"},{"t":126.339,"end":127.851,"chars":[3],"who":"Team Y Player","text":"He's there… but how!?","de":"Er ist da … aber wie!?","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/43.mp3"},{"t":127.836,"end":129.06,"chars":[6],"who":"Kunigami","text":"Go!","de":"Los!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/44.mp3"},{"t":129.351,"end":134.583,"chars":[9],"who":"Bachira","text":"Score it, you egoist. Yoichi Isagi!","de":"Hau ihn rein, du Egoist. Yoichi Isagi!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/45.mp3"},{"t":134.827,"end":137.995,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"I am… a striker!","de":"Ich bin … ein Stürmer!","orig":"scenes/isagis_first_goal/lines/46.mp3"}]}